ifficult to get close to, her appearance as if she were a sculpture is exactly suitable for the name of \"Senki\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But this time, she falls into a dastardly trap set by Elizabeth, and she is forced into captivity without even being allowed to resist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57979"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦場では常に先陣に立ち、敵をことごとく殲滅していく女指揮官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこか近寄り難い凛とした空気をまといながらも、まるで造形物であるかのようなその容姿はまさに『戦姫』の名にふさわしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし今回、エリザベートが仕掛けた卑劣な罠に嵌り抵抗する事すら許されずに敢え無く囚われの身となってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13707","sourceWorkId":"15579","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦場では常に先陣に立ち、敵をことごとく殲滅していく女指揮官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこか近寄り難い凛とした空気をまといながらも、まるで造形物であるかのようなその容姿はまさに “戦姫” の名にふさわしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし今回、エリザベートが仕掛けた卑劣な罠に嵌り、抵抗することすら許されずにあえなく囚われの身となってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"201356"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13707","sourceWorkId":"15579","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13707","sourceWorkId":"15579","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13707","sourceWorkId":"15579","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13707","sourceWorkId":"15579","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5fa7b8a793f7f5baca09f3ce40b7c6a0c008d3cf229242c5f826e01ac33df6f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4945aed2c3894cf9d264605aff82ca5b47d648d138dbd5b1497089411b74542.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"cred